<title>USA: Redbook sales said up 2.8 pct w/e Feb 15 - sources.</title>
<headline>Redbook sales said up 2.8 pct w/e Feb 15 - sources.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Redbook Retail Sales Index is expected to rise by 2.8 percent in the period ending February 15 after the 2.5 percent rise seen in the prior period, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Lynch, Jones &amp; Ryan Inc will report the Redbook Index on Tuesday at 1455 EST/1955 GMT.</p>
<p>((-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
